<title>GERMANY: Asta Medica profit rises 2.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Asta Medica profit rises 2.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   73.2    vs 71.3</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,383   vs 1,357</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German drugs group is Asta Medica AG. The company said it expected sales and profits to rise in 1996/97.</p>
</text>
